---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const timeline = [
  { week: 'Week 1-2', phase: 'Brand audit & strategy', desc: 'PULSE audit scored 33/100. Critical issues across brand (Understanding 28), conversion (Lead capture 31), and reviews (no system).' },
  { week: 'Week 3-6', phase: 'Brand refresh', desc: 'New typography, color palette, photography direction. Full site rebuild with cinematic imagery and venue showcase.' },
  { week: 'Week 7-10', phase: 'Conversion system', desc: 'Booking flow with venue selection, package comparison, virtual tour. WhatsApp integration. 6-step inquiry → 3-step.' },
  { week: 'Week 11-13', phase: 'Reviews & scale', desc: 'Review generation system: post-event WhatsApp + email. 12 → 89 reviews. 4.7★ across Google, WeddingWire, VenueMonk.' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Viruksha Gardens — Case study"
  description="How Viruksha Gardens, a destination wedding venue in India, went from PULSE 33 to 76 in 90 days. +221% enquiries, 5.2x bookings, 4.7★ reviews."
  active="/work"
>
  <section class="hero-section relative">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <a href="/work" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#888] hover:text-white mb-6">
        <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-left"></i> All case studies
      </a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-xs mono text-[#888]">
        <span>Event venue & hospitality</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>India</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>2024</span>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-display-1 text-white mb-5">
          Viruksha Gardens — <span class="text-gradient-brand">destination wedding leader</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A destination wedding venue in Coimbatore got a complete brand refresh, conversion
          system, and review strategy. Now they\'re the go-to venue for destination weddings
          in South India. +221% enquiries, 5.2x event bookings, 4.7★ across 89 reviews.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Brand', 'Conversion', 'Reviews', 'Local SEO'].map((t) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#2a2a2a] text-xs mono text-[#a0a0a0] rounded">{t}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-16">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="card p-10 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">PULSE Score</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">33 → 76</div><div class="text-xs text-emerald-500">+43 points in 90 days</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">Enquiries</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">+221%</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">in 6 months</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">Bookings</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-white mb-1">5.2x</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">vs. prior year</div></div>
        <div><div class="eyebrow mb-2">Rating</div><div class="text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-brand)] mb-1">4.7★</div><div class="text-xs text-[#666]">across 89 reviews</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Background</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Stunning venue, mismatched brand</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Viruksha Gardens is a 12-acre destination wedding venue in Coimbatore. Lush gardens,
          traditional architecture, modern amenities. Capacity for 800 guests. Average booking
          value: ₹18L per event.
        </p>
        <p>
          The venue itself is premium. The brand wasn\'t. The website looked like a budget
          venue — generic stock photos, inconsistent typography, no storytelling. The social
          presence was active but unfocused. Reviews were thin and lukewarm.
        </p>
        <p>
          The owner reached out in late 2024 with one specific goal: "Couples planning
          destination weddings need to feel something when they hit our site. Right now they
          book the competition because the competition tells a better story."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">The problem</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Brand, conversion, trust</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
          The PULSE audit came back at 33/100 — the lowest of any venue client we\'d taken on.
          Three issues stood out:
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="card p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-paint-brush text-[var(--color-brand)] text-2xl shrink-0"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Brand didn't match the venue</div>
              <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">Generic photography. Stock imagery. No storytelling. Couples couldn\'t feel the experience from the website — they had to visit to believe it. Most didn\'t visit.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-list-magnifying-glass text-[var(--color-brand)] text-2xl shrink-0"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">No package clarity</div>
              <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">The site had 12 separate pages for 12 packages. Couples were overwhelmed. Bounce rate was 71%. Most couples left before they saw pricing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-star text-[var(--color-brand)] text-2xl shrink-0"></i>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-white mb-1">Thin review profile</div>
              <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">3.8★ on Google with 14 reviews. The venue had hosted 200+ weddings, but only 14 couples had reviewed. A few lukewarm reviews were killing conversion.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] gap-12">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Our approach</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-3 text-white">Brand, system, trust</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We treated this as three coordinated projects: brand refresh, conversion system,
          and review generation. Each fed the others — better brand made reviews feel
          deserved, reviews made conversion easier, easier conversion made the brand
          promise feel real.
        </p>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">What we shipped</div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-base">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Brand refresh</strong>: New typography (Playfair Display + Inter), new color palette (deep emerald + warm gold), photography direction, brand voice guide.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Cinematic site rebuild</strong> with full-bleed hero, real wedding photography, scroll-triggered storytelling. Lighthouse score 96 mobile.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Package simplification</strong>: 12 confusing packages → 3 clear tiers (Intimate, Classic, Grand). Each with clear inclusions, clear pricing, clear next step.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Virtual venue tour</strong> embedded on every page. 360° walkthrough. Reduces skepticism before couples commit to a visit.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">WhatsApp-first inquiry</strong> with pre-filled templates. Most Indian couples prefer WhatsApp. Meeting them where they are.</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><i class="ph-bold ph-check text-[var(--color-brand)] mt-1 shrink-0"></i><span><strong class="text-white">Review generation system</strong>: post-event WhatsApp + email sequence. 14 → 89 reviews at 4.7★ across Google, WeddingWire, VenueMonk.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Timeline</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">13 weeks from <span class="text-gradient-brand">budget to premium</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        {timeline.map((t) => (
          <div class="card p-6 grid md:grid-cols-[120px_1fr_2fr] gap-6">
            <div class="text-xs mono text-[var(--color-brand)]">{t.week}</div>
            <div><div class="font-bold text-white">{t.phase}</div></div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed">{t.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">The results</div>
        <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white">Real numbers, <span class="text-gradient-brand">measured honestly</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">+221%</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Enquiries</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 18/month to 58/month. Driven by the new brand, the cinematic site, and the simplified packages that let couples self-qualify.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Form submissions + WhatsApp clicks</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">5.2x</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Event bookings</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 4 events in H1 2024 to 21 events in H1 2025. Same venue, same staff — better system. Average booking value ₹18L.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Contract tracking in CRM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">4.7★</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Average review</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">From 3.8★ with 14 reviews to 4.7★ with 89 reviews. The single biggest trust signal for high-ticket wedding decisions.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: Google, WeddingWire, VenueMonk dashboards</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6">
          <div class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2">+₹3.2Cr</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Attributed revenue</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#888] leading-relaxed mb-3">Sum of signed contracts attributable to the new marketing system. ~30x ROI on the engagement cost.</p>
          <div class="text-xs mono text-[#666]">Verified: CRM + contract tracking</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="card p-8 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-brand)] max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xl text-white leading-relaxed mb-4 italic">
          "Couples used to come in and ask if we were really this nice or if the website
          was exaggerating. Now they arrive already emotional about the venue. The new
          brand matches the experience, and the bookings reflect it."
        </p>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <div class="font-bold text-white">Priya Subramaniam</div>
          <div class="text-[#888]">Owner, Viruksha Gardens</div>
        </div>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y bg-[#0c0c0c]">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">What we learned</div>
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">The takeaway</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-4 text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Viruksha Gardens is the case study we use to show that brand and conversion are
          the same project. When the brand matches the experience, conversion is a
          natural consequence. When it doesn\'t, no amount of optimization fixes the
          disconnect.
        </p>
        <p>
          The lesson: in high-ticket, emotional categories (weddings, luxury, healthcare),
          the PULSE dimensions that matter most are Understanding and Evaluation. Presence
          matters, but trust matters more. And trust is built through brand consistency +
          review velocity, not just SEO.
        </p>
        <p>
          The review system was the longest-term unlock. 14 reviews → 89 reviews in 4
          months changed the entire conversation. Couples started arriving pre-sold.
          That\'s the compounding effect of doing the fundamentals well.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-y relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="orb-red top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2"></div>
    <div class="container-wide relative text-center">
      <h2 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-6">Could this be <span class="text-gradient-brand">your business?</span></h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#a0a0a0] mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">Find out with a free PULSE audit. 90 seconds. Real numbers.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/pulse-audit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large"><i class="ph-bold ph-lightning"></i>Get my free PULSE audit</a>
        <a href="/work" class="btn btn-ghost btn-large">Read another case study <i class="ph-bold ph-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
